      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2020 the Syndicate had gross claims outstanding of GBP 96.577m. During 2020 the Syndicate recorded a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 36.123m (reinsurers' share +GBP 16.187m, net release GBP 19.936m), predominantly reflecting favourable claims development and improved reinsurance recoveries. The year was materially affected by COVID-19 losses on the Contingency book in 2020 (separately quantified) while catastrophe scenario exposures (US windstorm and California earthquake scenarios) remain disclosed in the RDS table.",
